    "parent": "rack_A",
    "function": "Low-noise multi-channel current source biasing the flux lines of tunable qubits and couplers. Through the mutual inductance M it sets the flux and thus the qubit frequency; its noise floor and drift appear directly as flux noise, so it is filtered at every stage and often battery-backed. A sweep of one channel produces the flux-spectroscopy arc.",
